{
  "id": "394",
  "title": "Letter of Invitation",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-10-22",
  "synopsis": "Here is an invitation letter from a mobile phone store that is about to open in the area.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/553/27a57267daa953fa7c8e0b275a19c50f72701507.mp3?1508044008",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "邀请信\n\n王女士：\n    您好！我店定于十一月一日上午八时正式开业，当天上午九点在我店三楼举行手机展，十二点在明园酒店举行宴会。敬请光临！\n\n长城手机店\n2017年10月1日",
    "traditional": "邀請信\n\n王女士：\n    您好！我店定於十一月一日上午八時正式開業，當天上午九點在我店三樓舉行手機展，十二點在明園酒店舉行宴會。敬請光臨！\n\n長城手機店\n2017年10月1日"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Letter of Invitation"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王女士：",
      "traditional": "王女士：",
      "pinyin": "wáng nǚ shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ms. Wang:"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "您好！",
      "traditional": "您好！",
      "pinyin": "nín hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我店定于十一月一日上午八时正式开业，",
      "traditional": "我店定於十一月一日上午八時正式開業，",
      "pinyin": "wǒ diàn dìng yú shí yī yuè yí rì shàng wǔ bā shí zhèng shì kāi yè",
      "english": "Hello!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "当天上午九点在我店三楼举行手机展，",
      "traditional": "當天上午九點在我店三樓舉行手機展，",
      "pinyin": "dàng tiān shàng wǔ jiǔ diǎn zài wǒ diàn sān lóu jǔ xíng shǒu jī zhǎn",
      "english": "Our store will officially open at 8 o'clock on November 1st."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "十二点在明园酒店举行宴会。",
      "traditional": "十二點在明園酒店舉行宴會。",
      "pinyin": "shí èr diǎn zài míng yuán jiǔ diàn jǔ xíng yàn huì",
      "english": "On the same day at 9 in the morning, we will hold a mobile phone exhibition on the third floor of our store."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "敬请光临！",
      "traditional": "敬請光臨！",
      "pinyin": "jìng qǐng guāng lín",
      "english": "At twelve there will be a banquet at the Mingyuan hotel."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Please grace us with your presence!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "长城手机店",
      "traditional": "長城手機店",
      "pinyin": "cháng chéng shǒu jī diàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Great Wall Mobile Phone Store"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "2017年10月1日",
      "traditional": "2017年10月1日",
      "pinyin": "4 nián 1 yuè 1 rì",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
